WEBVTT

00:09:28.743 --> 00:09:30.378
But what about climate change?

00:09:30.968 --> 00:09:34.372
How do we ensure a high-energy
future for everyone

00:09:34.396 --> 00:09:36.359
while also curbing our emissions?

00:09:37.411 --> 00:09:40.559
Well, we'll have to make
some complex tradeoffs,

00:09:40.583 --> 00:09:42.957
but I believe that
a high-energy future for Africa

00:09:42.981 --> 00:09:45.697
is not mutually exclusive
to a low-carbon future.

00:09:46.239 --> 00:09:47.647
And make no mistake:

00:09:47.671 --> 00:09:50.611
the world cannot expect Africa
to remain in energy poverty

00:09:50.635 --> 00:09:52.149
because of climate change.

00:09:52.173 --> 00:09:55.942
(Applause)

00:09:59.949 --> 00:10:03.245
Actually, the facts show
that the opposite is true.